  title: Chalcolithic regional cultures
  text: "Major Chalcolithic cultures include Ahar\u2013Banas in Rajasthan, Kayatha and Malwa in Madhya Pradesh, Jorwe in Maharashtra, with sites such as Inamgaon and Daimabad, and the Ochre Coloured Pottery culture of the Ganga plain."
